zapiski-skuchayushchego-optsiona-name = notes of a bored optio
zapiski-skuchayushchego-optsiona-content = Been stuck at this outpost for the sixth moon. No goblins in sight, quiet as a crypt. Not a blade of grass moves. And that is what maddens me most. Better they came crawling, honest. Instead I sit, stare into the distance, fight off sleep, and let the wind run through my nose. No reinforcements, no relief. I sleep hugging my spear and eat porridge full of sand. Yesterday at dawn I hear rustling. Grabbed my sword, ran out, and there is a hedgehog snuffling by the wall. Nearly chopped its head off. Tomorrow I am sending Gaius on watch. I am sick of it. Let the goblins come already. They say fear the wolf and you will never enter the forest, but here there are not even wolves, only goblins in my thoughts.

starinnaya-zapiska-name = old note
starinnaya-zapiska-content = Third night holding them off. Goblins come on like locusts, stupid, vicious, and disgracefully fearless. Yesterday they climbed the wall over the bodies of their own dead. Decimus broke his leg. Flavius went deaf from their screeching. I can no longer tell day from night. Everything has run together into red mush.


    {"The arrows are gone. The spears are broken. We hold with swords and prayers. Cris grabbed a goblin by the scruff yesterday and slammed it against the wall so hard its skull burst. Said: \"At least I had some fun.\" Everyone is losing their mind."}

rozysknaya-listovka-name = wanted notice
rozysknaya-listovka-desc = The lower part of the sheet has been carelessly torn away, leaving only traces of dried blood in the paper fibers.
rozysknaya-listovka-content = [head=2]DECREE FOR THE SEARCH OF A TRAITOR[/head]

    {"[italic]In the name of the merciful Lord Legate[/italic]"}


    {"[bold]ATTENTION![/bold] Former Decurion Vsevolod Temnov, sentenced to death for bribery, has made a brazen escape. This traitor foully slew his brothers-in-arms on guard duty and defected to the rebels."}


    {"Anyone who sights this cur is to report immediately to the nearest patrol. Remember: Temnov is extremely dangerous, armed with legionary steel, and knows our secrets. A noose awaits anyone who gives him aid."}


    {"For delivery of this oathbreaker's head to the Chancellery, a rew..."}

