ukaz-o-rekvizitsii-desc = In the name of the Legion and the Empire, we declare that your house and all its contents are subject to requisition for the needs of the Legion. As compensation, you are granted the right to submit a claim for reimbursement and return of certain material assets after the end of hostilities.

